{"name": "Jelly Bubble", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stick together, bounce apart. Grab soap, mess with your friends.A cute but chaotic multiplayer party game where jelly creatures compete, collide, and betray each other. Play with up to 6 players online or 4 players locally, and jump into wild matches\u2014or build your own with the map editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/c94fe5fd02c6bb853f9e26fdc9aefb9c.poster.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"728\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/c94fe5fd02c6bb853f9e26fdc9aefb9c.webm?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/c94fe5fd02c6bb853f9e26fdc9aefb9c.mp4?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/8c9635ba91f5af4d2b4948fdbb3a1b9d.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this chaotic playground, soap is power. Pick it up from the ground. Steal it from others. Or lose it the second you grab it.That\u2019s just how it goes.More soap = stronger abilities. Bigger size = more control. Bring your soap back to the scoring point and climb the leaderboard \u2014 if you can make it there alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5589604c7a0934667f3b6d4be9c75151.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your bubble is both shield and weapon.Same colors attract\u2014get close, steal resources, or even absorb your opponent. Different colors repel\u2014bounce enemies away or save yourself at the last second.Switching colors at the right moment can turn the fight around.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/63364082760cc99be4e95da390092825.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soap doesn\u2019t just make you stronger.It can blast enemies away, swap positions, or save you in critical moments.Every piece of soap is a tactical choice.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6ef40c35011ade677eb94e93307352bc.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supports up to 6 players online or 2\u20134 players in local multiplayer. Dorm room gaming? Friends\u2019 party? Just gather your crew and it\u2019ll quickly turn into a chaotic friendship-destroying showdown. With multiple game modes and fun-filled challenges, every match brings a fresh experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/676ce1c00b5e69df7842a0a10fa72303.poster.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"760\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/676ce1c00b5e69df7842a0a10fa72303.webm?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/676ce1c00b5e69df7842a0a10fa72303.mp4?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/a6a40d458fdab7f0c85a77f399ba7ae0.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features a DIY map editor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A trampoline-only arena</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A full-speed boost racetrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Or something even more ridiculous</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Then share it with friends and see what happens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"408\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6998ed30c9681499f914122df2322cd6.poster.avif?t=1787209784\" width=\"760\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6998ed30c9681499f914122df2322cd6.webm?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6998ed30c9681499f914122df2322cd6.mp4?t=1787209784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to pick up, fast-paced, light competitive gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple competitive and cooperative modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique core mechanic: attract (same color) / bounce (different colors)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ types of soap with different effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom map creation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun customization and mix-and-match outfits</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 6-player online</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2\u20134 player local multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Stick with the same color, bounce off the rest! Snatch the soap, sabotage your friends! Adorable jelly critters are here for chaotic, hilarious showdowns! Supports 4-player local and up to 6-player online battles, plus a map editor so you can jump into laugh-out-loud matches anytime!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/12ba6d4f3bfa7ef680359d17b84ba0976401fad7/header.jpg?t=1787209784", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Funny", "Online Co-Op", "Party Game", "Cute", "Casual"], "developers": "BINGOBELL", "publishers": "BINGOBELL", "release_date": "Aug 4, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3659090", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "3 August 2025 - Request Access\n\n27 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/St7VI0S06yM", "first_seen": 1754179200.0, "review_rank": 1533}